<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-17T00:38:26.218Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:38:26 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gangs are kidnapping local officials in Mexico to force the release of detained members. The defense minister says cartels are using drones to track U.S. border agents and map smuggling routes. The U.S. Treasury has sanctioned four individuals and eleven entities tied to a cartel-controlled horse-racing network that includes links to New Mexico. Mexico has ordered social-media firms to remove content inciting violence within a month, while a disinformation campaign linked to a TV mogul is targeting minorities, and the conflict produced 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPR01KYUphZnRkb1BYc2NERUdWakRfeFZBenJqV2FnLTk0M2VCbDlMS05JMDUzVXk5dzFjalphYzhOek85U1plMkphWFF0cmF6eFBJQ2Q3S2NrUGhaZ2pCWmtwOEJJUkYyb3hDaG9VM0lpZUN2eWtBMW1VZ2F1ak80M2phYUVuODYyeGZuSjVqdmtZRnNLN2J5aHkyNUlWd0ozc3pOakFfdmhKZDdYcHFva3o1NmJpdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNR0RZWHVPdWR1NUVPeG1ZY3dxN1U0TFR5eVl1Z3czTW1hQXp1Um4yaUJMblQxSlZuNG05MGNaM2ZCejdhU0lEMFFhZUlOVGx5MEJsN0ZwS3pXa2QwMkcyaGxGMGpsODU1TGV3SUlKMkZTYXJ6U05rZUtPM0FYZnNwbTJWVGRYQ0hTM2Y5V3ZKd0pBSGxIbHJPREpLYjN6UDBZdEJuN0lSelk5eEhCc3NfWnJwUGwzb2U3M3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National Interest&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;BorderReport&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EL PAÍS English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQQ2pfMFNyNGVQdVBFTXhQbloxOTFNOHNjREM3RUE0VWhnb0lnRklJNUEya0d4RE1tLWo1YTNnaEFDTGV2MVotWi1HcmVEeW1NNzR6SDFVQXliSk5FUnBsdHNNekw3UzItZmVfNndpNGVwUFlZeEd4NFc0dnVFTk5WenNHVnpmMVJhbE9idzdPRW1UdU80RUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mexico Ledger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cU